  npm test,project,300,pi-agent,"2026-08-31T20:22:15.781Z",local_mutation,fix/tokenised-shell-scalars,full suite incl. the five bypass fixtures at audit level
  npm run coverage,project,300,pi-agent,"2026-08-31T20:22:16.548Z",local_mutation,fix/tokenised-shell-scalars,coverage gate thresholds must stay met
  npm run docstring,project,120,pi-agent,"2026-08-31T20:22:17.474Z",local_mutation,fix/tokenised-shell-scalars,docstring gate over the new exported declarations
  node scripts/verify-release-publish-attestation.ts,project,120,pi-agent,"2026-08-31T20:22:18.311Z",local_mutation,fix/tokenised-shell-scalars,the verifier green over this repository own tracked files
body: "Ported from the pm-todos reference (read, not copied): scripts/shell-command-scan.ts, scripts/verify-release-publish-attestation.ts, test/verify-release-publish-attestation.test.ts. Each fix gets an audit-level failing fixture paired with a genuinely attested sibling publish, a revert-red check, and mirror-direction guards so narrowing never blinds the scan."
